content:
Here are the domain objects:
```json
{
  "domain objects": [
    {
      "name": "Client",
      "description": "Person requesting landscaping services."
    },
    {
      "name": "Landscaping Request",
      "description": "Initial request from a Client describing desired landscaping work.",
      "attributes": [
        "Property Details"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Property Details",
      "description": "Information about the Client’s property relevant to design and planning."
    },
    {
      "name": "Landscape Designer",
      "description": "Professional responsible for creating design concepts and project plans."
    },
    {
      "name": "Design Concept",
      "description": "Proposed visual and functional layout for the Client’s landscape."
    },
    {
      "name": "Project Plan",
      "description": "Detailed plan defining required Materials and Tasks for the project.",
      "attributes": [
        "Material",
        "Task"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Material",
      "description": "Item such as plants or tools needed to complete landscaping tasks."
    },
    {
      "name": "Task",
      "description": "Work unit required to carry out the Project Plan."
    },
    {
      "name": "Crew Member",
      "description": "Worker performing Tasks defined in the Project Plan."
    },
    {
      "name": "Supply Shortage Report",
      "description": "Report indicating insufficient Materials during project execution."
    },
    {
      "name": "Supply Manager",
      "description": "Person responsible for monitoring inventory and ordering Materials."
    },
    {
      "name": "Inventory",
      "description": "Collection of available Materials for ongoing and future projects.",
      "attributes": [
        "Material"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Supply Order",
      "description": "Request sent to a Supplier to replenish needed Materials."
    },
    {
      "name": "Supply Delivery",
      "description": "Shipment of Materials arriving from a Supplier."
    },
    {
      "name": "Supplier",
      "description": "External provider fulfilling Supply Orders."
    },
    {
      "name": "Landscaping Review",
      "description": "Evaluation by the Landscape Designer comparing completed work to the design."
    }
  ]
}
```
